OL,3,GNEWSA'Kind-hearted' residents help
OL,4,Alorry stuck at bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry driver who became stranded at a
OL,7,Frailway bridge was helped by residents
OL,8,Fto complete a "tricky" u-turn.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said the motorist was
OL,11,Funable to pass with the over-height
OL,12,Fvehicle and "came face-to-face" with
OL,13,Fthe bridge in Twyford Road, Willington,
OL,14,Fon Friday.
OL,16,FThe driver was supported by
OL,17,F"kind-hearted" residents, who stepped
OL,18,Fin to help guide the manoeuvre and
OL,19,F"carefully managed" to get the lorry
OL,20,Fturned around safely, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
